539   832E              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
540   832E              ; Port EF text logger (ASCII bytes, same convention as Project112).
541   832E              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
542   832E              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
543   832E              ; Spectrum display and keyboard control.
544   832E              ; RST 10h is the Spectrum ROM PRINT-OUT entry (current channel #2).
545   832E              ; SPACE is bit 0 of keyboard row 7F7F, active low.
546   832E              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
